        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek Multi Purpose Locking Surface Bolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis multi purpose keyed locking slide bolt is surface mounted with two concealed screws. Can be used on Patio Doors, Sliding Glass Doors, Bi-Fold Doors, Windows or Utility Doors. Available in Black, Bronze, Silver or White. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWith a 2 inch long locking pin it can span larger gaps than most surface bolts. For both vertical or horizontal applications. Includes both mortise and universal strike plates. Packaged with 2 keys and installation hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-8148-size.gif?v=1704354501\" width=\"600\" height=\"120\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Patio Door Bolt Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Multi Purpose Locking Surface Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 6-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Body Length: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Body Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Body Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Throw: 2\"</li> \r\n<li>Package includes: (1) bolt, strike, (2) keyes, and mounting hardware with (2) #10 mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/20601x-install.pdf?v=1704262399\"><b>Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nSelect your color below, available in Black, Bronze, Silver or White. \r\n</p>",
